window.products.push({"id":758064,"name":"CLOBOT Robotic Vacuum Cleaner X11, Robot Vacuum with 2600 Pa Strong Suction, Smart Dynamic Navigation 2.0, Self-Charging & Direct Charging, 150min Run","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFFt0RZ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Planned Routes & Advanced Infrared Detection 2nd Gen- Intelligent navigation 2.0 are better than before, allowing the Clobot robotic vacuum to clean your home with a planned route, reducing repetitive cleaning and improving more cleaning efficiency. Advanced infrared sensing technology 2.0 allows the robot vacuum to avoid accurately furniture, walls, and stairs, extending the life of the machine. Multiple Charging & Control Ways - The 2600 mAh large capacity battery allows the robot vacuum to run for up to 150 minutes, and the robot in a low battery state will return automatically to the charging base. Beside, you can choose charge directly the robot vacuum by adapter to power supply. The upgrade 2nd Gen wifi connection & remote control are available. You can pick your favorite ways such as remote control, APP, Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant to control the this smart robot vacuum. Adjustable Suction & Ultra-thin Body - 2600pa/1200pa/500pa, 3 levels of suction power selection, the max suction power can pick up hair, food crumbs, and dust on the floor, giving you a clean and safe home. 2.95 inches of the ultra-thin body can probe under and around the furniture, especially in some narrow and hard-to-reach areas, make the dust has nowhere to hide. **Please note that the total tall is approximately 3.25'' including wheels. 3 Brush Cleaning System & Multiple Cleaning Modes - The two side brushes increase the area and time of contact with the edges and corners of the room, removing easily overlooked debris. The main brushes and the brush assembly with bristles allow the vacuum cleaner to reduce hair tangling and improve cleaning efficiency. The automatic cleaning mode cleans the room, the spotting mode deals with the dense area of dust in your home, and the edge mode removes dust from the edges and corners. Three Layers of Filters & Large Dust Box - The three-layer filter consists of a basic filter, a filter sponge, and a high-efficiency filter. The basic filter blocks most of the hair and debris, the cotton filter will keep out the dust, and the high-efficiency filter stops tiny particles from entering the air to protect you and your family's health. 600ML large-capacity dust box can meet the requirement for multiple cleaning, the mother's gift and enjoy your leisure time with your family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFFt0RZ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CLOBOT","source_asin":"B09HGTDF3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HGTDF3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HGTDF3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":758065,"name":"Style Master Monarch Cotton Rich Diamond Woven Jacquard Bedspread, Full, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YL+x3J4fL._AC_SL1447_.jpg","description":"Monarch diamond cotton rich woven jacquard bedspread adds a classic tailored look to any bedroom. The bedspread is 55-percent cotton and 45-percent polyester for easy care. Machine wash color water. Wash separately. Use mild soap and non chlorine beach if needed. Tumble dry low. Use warm iron is needed. The bedspread comes in all four standard bed sizes: twin, full, queen and king and has matching shams available speparately. Monarch coves the entire bed down to the floor so no bed skirt is needed. The twn measures 81x96 inches, the full 96x110 inches, the queen 102x110 inches and the king 120x110 inches. Monarch comes in 4 colors to match most decors. The colors include cranberry, expresso, ivory and royal blue. it is crafted with pride in China","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YL+x3J4fL._AC_SL1447_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Style Master","source_asin":"B003TLOELI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003TLOELI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003TLOELI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
