window.products.push({"id":758151,"name":"Beefeta Vegetable Cutter Multifunctional,Mandoline Slicer Veggie Cutter for Kitchen,Safe Potato Slicer,Food Chopper Grater Slicer,Suitable for Vegetab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QIpZYu19L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beefeta Vegetable slicer for slicing, shredding and cutting frozen meat, you will free your hands to chop, slice and shred vegetables. With it, you can spend less time preparing food, saving your time and increasing efficiency. How to use 1.Put the vegetable cutterinto the transparent boxwith the bipod standsapart. 2.lnstall the transparentfeeder. 3.Insert the blade into theslot. 4.Put food into transparentfeeder, press with thefood pusher, then pressthe handle up and downrepeatedly to cut food. 5.Before cutting, if the food size is too large, you need to divide it into the right size before putting it in, then you can cut the shape you want. Notes 1.This product is only suitable for cutting soft food materials such as vegetables, and not too hard food, so as not to damage the blade and the product. 2.Blade is sharp, plz be careful.Do not reach into the cutting opening or touch the blade to avoid injury or damage. 3.Do not place the product near open flames or heat sources,so as not to deform. 4.Before use, confirm that all accessories are installed in place and operate freely. Do not use excessive force to cause damage to the product. 5.Please make sure that all kinds of meat are frozen before cutting(Meat has to be without bones). 6.Before cutting, if the food size is too large, you need to divide it into the right size before putting it in, then you can cut the shape you want. Package Included Multifunctional vegetable cutter x1 Fine blade 3.5mm x1 Coarse blade 7mm x1 Slicing blade(thin:2mm thick:4mm) x1 Food container x1 Cleaning brush x1 Instructions x1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QIpZYu19L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beefeta","source_asin":"B09J25NBWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J25NBWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J25NBWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
