window.products.push({"id":758234,"name":"Frankincense and Myrrh Scented Soy Candle Vegan Spell Meditation Altar - Ritual 4oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412BwJ+-NbL.jpg","description":"Fragrance notes: frankincense and myrrh Bring some ritual magic into your life! Frankincense and myrrh were among the most precious of substances in ancient times. They maintain their vital importance as burnt offerings during ritual practices as priests, shamans, and spiritual healers attempt to communicate with the mystical world. This enchanting blend infused with natural essential oils creates an elegant sensory experience that is exotic and spicy, yet also mild and calming. Invite some ritual into your life with this enthralling essence of frankincense and myrrh that will set the perfect mood for meditation and magic.  OVERVIEW: ► 4 oz soy candle in a classic round jar ► Gift box included ► $1 from each candle sold supports wolf conservation ► Hand poured with care in small batches ► Perfectly scented with essential oil and perfume oil blends ► Hand blended with these simple ingredients: natural soy wax, cotton wick, premium fragrances, magic ► Vegan candle that contains no dyes, parabens, phthalates, or other toxins ► 25-30 hour burn time when following proper candle care  ► I stand by my products. If for any reason you are not satisfied please send me a message. - Harmony (Old Soul Artisan founder and candlesmith)  ** TIP: To enjoy your candle longer, we recommend not burning for more than 4 hours at a time and to trim the wick between burns. Let your candle melt pool reach to the sides of the jar each time you burn to ensure an even burn throughout the life of the candle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412BwJ+-NbL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old Soul Artisan","source_asin":"B07GJMZ35F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GJMZ35F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GJMZ35F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
