window.products.push({"id":758284,"name":"100 Percent Cotton Towel Set, Zero Twist, Soft and Absorbent 6 Piece Set With 2 Bath Towels, 2 Hand Towels and 2 Washcloths (Burgundy) By Lavish Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lF4zgOI-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Lavish Home Zero Twist Collection brings a whole new meaning to the world of plush. Fluffy, soft and super-absorbent even after repeat washes, these heavy duty cotton towels are super breathable and lightweight, combining comfort, aesthetics and functionality into one! This six piece set will be the perfect addition to any home, bathroom or washroom! IMPORTANT: Avoid buying counterfeit products and transacting with unauthorized sellers. Look for our logo on the packaging for every one of our products. Lavish Home is committed to providing the consumer with the absolute best price and value on all of our products, which we ensure by applying a rigorous Quality Control process. Lavish Home is a registered trademark protected by U.S. Trademark law and will be vigorously defended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lF4zgOI-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lavish Home","source_asin":"B082LL19WW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082LL19WW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082LL19WW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":758285,"name":"Winlyn Set of 1 Farmhouse Galvanized Metal Milk Can Vase with Artificial Eucalyptus Leaves with White Seeds Greenery Arrangement for Rustic Wedding Ta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EUYM01P+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: Package includes 1 pc galvanized metal milk can with 4 pcs fake seeded silver dollar eucalyptus leaves stems and 4 pcs fake baby eucalyptus leaves stems. The artificial eucalyptus stems and the galvanized milk jug comes separately, so you can add your own floral stems in the jug to get a custom match to your home decor or remove the faux greenery from the jug and use them separately. This faux potted greenery arrangement is a great touch for tabletop, tiered tray, or countertops. Color: Faux eucalyptus leaves stems feature gray green silver dollar eucalyptus leaves with white seed clusters attached on a brown stem, while green baby eucalyptus leaves attached on a green stem. The galvanized milk can planter features a narrow opening at the top with two arched handles on either side, finished off with a burlap bow for a rustic chic touch. This simple and elegant design makes a charming accent to any room, increases the farmhouse charm and brings the outdoor beauty in. Size: The artificial eucalyptus leaves sprays measure about 10.4\"-13.5\" tall and 6\"-6.5\" wide. The farmhouse galvanized milk can measures about 7.3\" tall and 5.5\" wide, the opening diameter is about 3.1\", and the bottom diameter is about 4.3\". When filled with the artificial greenery measures about 13.8\" tall and 10.6\" wide. This artificial potted greenery arrangement is ideal for placing on tiered tray, shelves, countertops, or as a stand-alone centerpiece. Material: Fake eucalyptus leaves stems are made of silk and plastic, the plastic stems are wired, you can twist them in any way you want. Milk can planter is made from galvanized metal and has a gray distressed finish to add an antique appeal, accented with a simple burlap bow. It has a lightweight design that lets you choose the optimal place for it. This vintage artificial eucalyptus arrangement brings everlasting green to your indoor decor with no need of watering and additional upkeep. Use this country-chic fake potted greenery arrangement to create a farmhouse atmosphere in your home. It is a perfect accent for your coffee table, tiered tray, shelves, mantel, dining table, kitchen counter, floating shelf, office desk, side table, nightstand, bathroom sink, entryway table, windowsill, dresser, living room, porch, low light places, and more. Also, it makes a farmhouse centerpiece for special event or as a great housewarming gift, birthday gift, holiday gift, and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EUYM01P+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B09VK6WVVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VK6WVVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VK6WVVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
