window.products.push({"id":758306,"name":"BERDECIA 5 Panels Blue Butterfly Wall Art Large Canvas Flash Realism Oil Paintings Framed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613MNBjmlOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT TECHNOLOGY & FUCTIONS & STYLETECHNOLOGYOur BERDECIA featured high definition picture photo prints painting with high density output technique on canvas.FUCTIONSwe commitment to create look and feel of the original nature and masterpiece, by grabbing a wonderful moment of nature and life picture with vivid color to brighten your home wall and relax you after work and provide you a wonderful living & working atmosphere . STYLEOur decorative oil paintings including modern art, contemporary art, abstract art, famous art, pop art etc, can be used for Home Furnishing, Gaestgiveriet Hotel, restaurant, living room, bedroom, KTV, club etc.  MAINTENANCE ADVICE.1.Avoid painting long-time exposure to sunlight lest cause discoloration or fade problems.2.If placed in living room, keep house clean to avoid accumulation of dust and pesticides.anti sprays, cigarettes and other touch painting, also note to ventilation and anti moisture, put away painting from bathroom and kitchen to avoid material damaged or other bad changes 3. To prevent dust and insects into corrosion of painting , other than frame, you can boarded behind painting4.Avoid great change of humidity and temperature to prevent material expansion or contraction of painting, better not to close to window CLEANNESS SUGGESTION1.Not remove frame dust with cleaning agent, sponge, vacuum cleaners, use special cleaning to clean painting2.Usually can use soft brush or feather duster to clean paint, then wipe with clean cloth dipped in water, if dirty, use softsoap water to wipe, then wipe again with clean water, note that if soled canvas, wipe it after screwed water 3.If there is Lampblack on painting, use soap and water successively and then wipe with dry cloth or paper towel to draw water out","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613MNBjmlOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BERDECIA","source_asin":"B07145ZVZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07145ZVZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07145ZVZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
