window.products.push({"id":758531,"name":"Bayco IPX7 Waterproof Food Meat Thermometer for Cooking, Digital Instant Read Kitchen Food Candy Thermometer, Highly Accurate Cooking Thermometer with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mcdy-YPcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[SUPER FAST & HIGHLY ACCURATE] 2-3s ultra fast response time and the cooking thermometer with temp range of -58°F ~ 572°F (-50°C ~ 300°C) with accuracy of 1℃. Simply insert probe into your food or liquid and get the temp. Accurate and fast measurement can save time and avoid problems caused by overdone or under cooked food. Perfect for all sorts of cooking activities such as meats, baking, candy, liquids and BBQ, etc. You can enjoy delicious food with your family and friends. [One-Button Multifunction] Easy to use for one-button can operate multiple functions. Except ON/OFF switch, you can also convert ℃ or ℉ according to your usage habits. Both locking and calibration functions are available, which locking facilitates temperature measurements, and re-calibration provides you a more accurate reading.The thermometer will auto-shut off if it is idle for 10 minutes, which can save battery life. [IPX7 Waterproof] Protects the screen and extends the product's life by preventing water or hot steam from entering. Please avoid directly immersing the thermometer under water to wash. [Large Backlight Display& Folding Probe] Negative backlight LCD display design allows you can always read the temperature although you are grilling in the dark. The folding probe can be rotated by any angle as you want to better test food temperature. Easily and locks into base for portability. You can hang it on the wall or store it in a cabinet. Magnetic back and hook also allow you to easily attach to refrigerator or any metal surface. [QUALITY CUSTOMER CARE] BAYCO offers a full day after-sales service. If you are not satisfied with your products or any other problem, please contact our store. We will provide the best solution to refund or resend within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mcdy-YPcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAYCO","source_asin":"B0894NT8YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0894NT8YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0894NT8YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
