window.products.push({"id":758578,"name":"Neomious 6 pcs Beeswax Taper Candles, White Candle Sticks, Natural White Tapered Candles, 10 Inch Dripless Taper Candles, Bees Wax Candle Stick for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GUs006dHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Rediscover the beauty of classic beeswax candles. With so many cheap paraffin or flashy soy-based options, it can be easy to overlook beeswax candles. But if you're looking for natural candles that don't have a cloying fragrance or don't emit soot, beeswax is a very strong choice. Aside from having an incredibly long burn time, beeswax can even help improve the air quality in your room by releasing negative ions. If you're looking for functional and gorgeous candles that you can proudly display, look no further than our tapered candles. The Beeswax Taper Candles by Neomious deliver the benefits of beeswax in exciting colors! All our tapered candles are crafted with only natural beeswax–no synthetic additives. Beeswax helps naturally clean air by releasing negative particles that bind with positively charged particles like dust, pollen, or bad odors. Plus, it emits a mild, earthy aroma with notes of honey, a wholesome scent that calms without overwhelming your senses. Enjoy the romantic flickering and clean burn of these tapered candles. Beeswax has a high melting point, meaning our candles produce a brighter flame. Lit in a room with no drafts, they'll burn without dripping or producing smoke. Add a pop of color to your shelves, mantle, and tabletops. In addition to its natural Yellow color, these beeswax candles come in beautiful White, Black, and Pink hues that you'll love to display around your home. More reasons to love our beeswax taper candles: - Generous supply of six 10” candles per pack - Eco-conscious alternative to paraffin wax candles - Great for people with sensitivities to fragrance and soot - Perfect for dinner table candelabras Make the switch to naturally made colored candles. Add the Neomious Natural Beeswax Taper Candles to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GUs006dHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEOMIOUS","source_asin":"B0BS1GW9TC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS1GW9TC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS1GW9TC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
