window.products.push({"id":758681,"name":"11 oz Tumbler Candle With Wood Wick Scented with Essential Oils","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710l3rRhB7L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our natural hand poured soy candles with essential oils add a luxury compared to no other. Our Wonderful Scents soy candles are made of 100% soy wax grown from sustainable farms by local US farmers. WHY WE CHOOSE SOY Soy wax is derived from vegetables (soybeans) and paraffin wax is derived from petroleum (a refined gasoline product). We were looking for a natural, renewable resource that was sourced here in the United states for our Wonderful Scents candle collection. A FUN FACT Here is an interesting/fun fact about the history of soy wax. Soy wax was invented by a group of Purdue college students in 1996. The students had to develop a birthday candle using a renewable resource. WOOD WICKS Our wood wicks are not only unique, but are also made from lumber sourced from Forest Stewardship Council (FSC) certified mills in the United States. The FSC is dedicated to promoting responsible forestry and ensures the mills are meeting the highest environmental and social standards. INGREDIENTS 100% Soy Wax sourced from Wisconsin Farms 100% Soy Wax sourced from Wisconsin Farms FSC Wood Wick FSC Wood Wick 11 oz Glass Container produced In Louisiana 11 oz Glass Container produced In Louisiana Hand Poured in the USA Hand Poured in the USA SPECIFICATIONS Style: Glass Tumbler Style: Glass Tumbler Weight: 11 oz oz Weight: 11 oz oz Lid: None Lid: None Method: Hand Poured Method: Hand Poured Wick: Wood Wick: Wood Scents: Eucalyptus, Eucalyptus and Spearmint, Lavender, Orange Clove, Sage Leaf, Minted Rosemary, Patchouli, Lemongrass Kiwi, Ginger and Frankincense, Cedarwood and Amber, Bergamont and Terragon, and Relaxation / Aromatherapy Scents: Eucalyptus, Eucalyptus and Spearmint, Lavender, Orange Clove, Sage Leaf, Minted Rosemary, Patchouli, Lemongrass Kiwi, Ginger and Frankincense, Cedarwood and Amber, Bergamont and Terragon, and Relaxation / Aromatherapy ADDITIONAL INFORMATION FREE SHIPPING On All Orders FREE SHIPPING On All Orders 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED. Customer satisfaction is always our top priority 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED. Customer satisfaction is always our top priority","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710l3rRhB7L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonderful Scents","source_asin":"B076XZNLRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076XZNLRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076XZNLRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
