window.products.push({"id":758759,"name":"Waterproof Digital Instant Read Meat Thermometer Kitchen Food Cooking Thermometer with Backlight LCD and Magnet Kitchen Red Thermometer Probe for BBQ ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LcMFofaXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product description *Package Included: 1 x Red Digital Food Thermometer T168 2 x CR2032 Lithium Battery (3V) 1 x User Manual Box Size 17*4.5*2.5 cm: Gross weight 77g *Waterproof - It can survive if dropped in water or liquid *Large Bright LCD with backlit light that with auto-shutoff *Magnet enables vertical attachment to refrigerator or other metal element/surface *Hold temperature function to stop the display from changing the readout Min/Max *Auto-off: the unit will automatically turn off after 10 minutes if no other buttons are pressed keep battery life *°F/°C switchable with a push of the button *Measurement range: -50°C to 300°C (-58°F to 572°F). Measurement accuracy: + 1°C (2°F) between - 20°C to 150°C (39°F/302°F) Measurement accuracy: + 1°C (2°F) between - 20°C to 150°C (39°F/302°F) Measurement accuracy: 2°C (4°F) more than 150°C (302°F) Measurement accuracy: 2°C (4°F) more than 150°C (302°F) Operation Before using the thermometer please peel off protective film from the front panel! * To begin temperature measurement, unfold the probe from its housing and the LCD will immediately display the temperature. * Toggle between Celsius and Fahrenheit by pushing the C/F key. * Data-hold: before withdrawing from food, press \" HOLD\" - this will hold the temperature reading until pressed again. * To display the minimum or the maximum temperature, push the “HOLD\" key for 3 seconds. It will first display the saved maximum temperature. By clicking \"HOLD\" again, the display will show the minimum saved temperature. * To enable light on the screen, press the light button. It will turn off after several seconds. * To turn off/on the temperature, hold down the \"off/on\" key for 5 seconds. Warnings and precautions *DO NOT LEAVE THE THERMOMETER IN THE OVEN WHILE COOKING! *DO NOT TOUCH HOT PROBE WITH BARE HANDS!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LcMFofaXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Y&Y HOME","source_asin":"B08HDF2YWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HDF2YWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HDF2YWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
