window.products.push({"id":758771,"name":"D-FantiX Christmas Gnomes Light Up, 27 Inch Large Swedish Tomte Gnome Plush Long Legs with Led Lights Scandinavian Santa Christmas Ornaments Winter Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YXD3OnjoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Gnomes Christmas Decorations - Gnome, also known as a Tomte or Nisse. In folklore, Gnome guards home and protect people from misfortune. The elf gnome plush will bring us good luck, happiness, warmth and also add a little magical to our home. Package includes two gnome plush. Light Up Gnome The gnome features a warm glowing LED light body with convenient steady/flash mode, powered by 3 AA batteries (not included), adds festive atmosphere. Short plush white beard & hair, knitted hat with classic Christmas snowflake elements, go particularly well with your festive decorations. Premium Quality & Fine Craftsmanship - The Christmas Holiday Gnomes are all made by professional artisans, featuring a knitting hat with star on the top and flexible wire inside, bendable to any poses you like. Made of knitwear and premium fiber fur, white hairy beard and stuffed nose, non-toxic and odorless. Christmas Decorations - The couple Christmas gnomes will be a joy to you and good mood and give any interior an atmosphere of comfort and fairy tales. Place them on your table/desk/fireplace/bookshelf to bring a bit of whimsical cheer to the home/office. Each Gnome plush is absolutely charming and will win over any Gnome lover’s heart. Perfect Gift Idea - The adorable tomte gnome is traditionalist and perfect for spreading holiday spirit and bring good luck to whole family. They are fun, adorable and quirky which makes them perfect for yourself and/or gifts for Birthday, Valentine’s Day, Thanksgiving and Christmas holiday decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YXD3OnjoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D-FantiX","source_asin":"B089PYW2B7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089PYW2B7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089PYW2B7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
