window.products.push({"id":758928,"name":"Prochaska Gallery Hand Blown Glass Llama Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d5TFfTbRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Hand blown glass llama figurine just might be the most adorable of your collectible llama sculptures. Kevin Prochaska, Disneyland glass blower for 10 years is the artist. It is no wonder why folks are attracted to this unusual animal with its large doe eyes, long rabbit ears, toes on each foot, giraffe like neck, and fur that is used in fine woolens. Living where I do, in the backcountry of San Diego County, there are many llama farms to visit and enjoy. I hope I have done justice to this animal’s charming characteristics. I make the sculpture entirely by hand from borosilicate crystal. The brilliant rainbow of colors is created when I apply pure gold to the glass while it is still molten. Llama measures approximately 5 inches in height and 3 inches long. Your purchase includes a lovely information card trimmed with gold foil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d5TFfTbRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prochaska Gallery","source_asin":"B0060QQOO4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0060QQOO4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0060QQOO4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":758929,"name":"KOBOT RCS212-C Robot Vacuum, 14.17x14.17x4.13, Champagne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ZHduvTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The KOBOT Cyclone Series Robot Vacuum utilizes a special brushless design to be a specialist for Hairs, Area Rugs, and Carpets and has all the features to make daily cleaning simple. The slim cyclone design helps clean hard to reach areas that other cyclone robot vacuums cannot reach. The KOBOT utilizes cyclone technology for a more powerful suction than average robot vacuums on the market. Its gentle touch sensitive bumpers won't harm your furniture or baseboards. Equipped with fall prevention sensors, the robot can clean around stairs and ledges. The preprogrammed intelligent movement patterns maximize room coverage. After cleaning, it will start its journey back to the charging dock automatically. \"Double Clean\" mode has the robot clean the space, return to the base to recharge, and will automatically go back out to clean for a thorough secondary clean. The KOBOT also works around your schedule with the Daily Scheduling feature which allows you to choose when you would like to clean the space, by selecting the time of day you wish on the charging dock. Imagine a cleaner space with the freedom to spend time doing other things, rather than worrying about chores!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ZHduvTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOBOT","source_asin":"B07SJJ8XBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SJJ8XBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SJJ8XBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":758930,"name":"Great Bay Home 4-Piece Geometric Printed Ultra-Soft Microfiber Sheet Set Wrinkle Free, Comfortable, All-Season Bed Sheets Lovelyn Collection (King, Ge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qxfpi2r+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GEOMETRIC PRINTED PATTERNS: Choose from a variety of beautiful, fade-resistant patterns. Each set comes with 1 fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet and 2 pillowcases (1 for Twin size). HOTEL/SPA QUALITY: These affordable microfiber sheets feel silky smooth against your skin. They're made from 90 GSM material that keeps you cool in the summer and toasty warm in winter. This 100% microfiber fabric is WARM, SOFT, FLEXIBLE, and BREATHABLE for maximum sleep comfort. PERFECT FIT EVERY TIME: Pocket size fits 14\" for Full, Queen, King & California King and 12\" for Twin & Twin XL. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: Customer satisfaction is of utmost importance to us. We’re confident you’ll love our products, but if you’re not 100% SATISFIED, our customer service team will work with you to make it right! EASY CARE AND EASY WASH: Machine washable for your convenience. Fade, stain, shrink, wrinkle and pill resistant. 100% microfiber fabric makes these sheets ultra-durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qxfpi2r+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Great Bay Home","source_asin":"B0949N4NRP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0949N4NRP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0949N4NRP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":758931,"name":"KES Hair Dryer Holder with Towel Bar, Over Cabinet Door Hair Tool Organizer Under Sink Styling Tool Organizer Curling Iron Organizers and Storage Flat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719TRzMfEKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create Extra Storage Space: To create extra storage space on your cabinet doors, KES designed this hair dryer holder with an internal hanging cabinet door basket to store your hair tools, and an external towel bar to hang a hand towel or washcloth. This hair tool organizer makes the best of solving the lack of storage space in small bathrooms. Adjust the Height As Needed: Unlike similar products with a fixed height that may not fit the cabinet doors or your hair tools, KES designs three different heights for the blow dryer holder that can be adjusted to 12.2\" (31cm), 14\" (35.5cm), or 16\" (40.5cm) to match your cabinet doors and different-sized hair tools. Now you don't need to worry about the organizer being too tall to close and open the cabinet door. Prevent Scratching Door: Four pieces of EVA protection pads (1mm & 2mm thick) for the back of metal rods prevent your cabinet door from scratching. Easily trim to size for a perfect fit. Flat Iron Structure - Strong Load Capacity: Unlike other products made of round wire frames that are easily deformed after a long time of use, KES adapts flat irons to keep the rack sturdy and resist bending. This KES hair dryer organizer allows you to neatly store the hair tools such as hairdryers with a length of up to 11.8\" (30cm), straighteners, and so on. You can also store the shampoo, lotion, etc. It holds up to 11lbs/5kg so you can rest assured to store heavy items. Easy to Assemble In A Minute: Everything you need to assemble this bathroom cabinet door organizer is included in the package. This over-the-door organizer is easy enough to install on your own within a minute. Just tighten the towel bar to the basket with two heavy-duty screws and hang it over your cabinet door then it is ready to be used. No drilling is required!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719TRzMfEKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KES","source_asin":"B0C1ZB51SR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1ZB51SR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1ZB51SR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
