window.products.push({"id":758975,"name":"Wine Stopper, Onearf 2 in 1 Wine Pourer Stoppers, Flower Wine Aerator Pourer, Silicone Bottle Pourers for Alcohol, Reusable Leakproof Wine Preserver K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZHkyZQ7sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Unique and Novel 2 in 1 Design] The appearance design of Onearf Wine Aerator Pourer is the shape of flower petals. When the petals are folded and overlapped, it is used as a bottle stopper. It has excellent sealing and can store red wine for a long time. Twist the cork to the right, the petals are separated. Then it becomes a wine pouring device to bring a better taste experience to your red wine. The 2-in-1 design will exactly bring convenience to your daily use. [Safe Material and No Leakage] Made from high-quality food-grade silicone inside and durable ABS outside, Onearf wine bottle stopper is non-toxic and safe for the human body. The wine stoppers silicone fits most wine bottles with an inner diameter of 18-20mm. Easily insert into the bottle, it can air-tight seal your wine bottle to prolong and preserve the wine flavor. [Dual Function and Wide Application] In terms of functions, Onearf product has the functions of a leak-free bottle sealer and red wine drip-free pourer at the same time. It's one of the best wine accessories suitable for all kinds of occasions, such as daily drinking, dating, family gathering and business dinner, etc. To clean the bottle stopper, just simply rinse with cold water, dry with a rag and preserver. Very convenient for you to use. [Ideal Gift for Wine Lovers] In addition to being a very practical red wine accessory, Onearf Flower wine stopper&Pourer is also an exquisite decor and wine accessories gift for women. This wine filter combines pouring wine with sealing&preservation. With Flower design, the wine stoppers themselves are elegant and unique. It's a beautiful present for weddings, Christmas, anniversaries, and birthdays. Your friend can taste and store opened wine easily with these reusable wine aerator stoppers. [24-Hour Online Service & Satisfaction Guarantee] Choose us, and you'll get a Risk-free 30-day trial — enjoy your return or replacement policy. We have life long time online service for you to timely solve your problem. If unluckily our stoppers are not suitable for your bottle mouth, you can contact us and we'll provide you with a return service. Please rest assured to buy it. We are happy and guarantee to provide you with satisfactory service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZHkyZQ7sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ONEARF","source_asin":"B09X2K13PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-758975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X2K13PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X2K13PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
